Subject: Cantor Identity Accounting Workspace P0 Exploded View

& [IdentityPlane]
  + immutable handle and type
  + same-type distinct membership
  + mutable record content and version

& [ProjectionPlane]
  + complete deterministic register
  + exact frame ledger and register binding
  + byte-budget refusal instead of truncation

& [ReferencePlane]
  + exact handle
  + unique normalized label
  + ambiguous candidate set
  + unknown refusal

& [TransactionPlane]
  + expected ledger digest
  + expected object version
  + one-object patch
  + member-set conservation

& [CoveragePlane]
  + one disposition per member
  + unresolved means held
  + missing or foreign member means invalid receipt
